  "description": "Nalix.Shared provides the foundational low-level primitives and shared utilities for the Nalix ecosystem — including configuration binding, memory pooling, LZ4 compression, high-performance messaging, and lightweight serialization.\n\nIt is optimized for zero-allocation patterns, Span<T>-based APIs, and unsafe memory access to achieve maximum throughput in real-time and networking environments.",
